  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 812.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the licensing requirements for all ambulatory surgical centers (ASC) pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(d).\n\nSource. #5514, eff 11-25-92; ss by #6530, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRED: 6-27-05\n\nNew. #9727-A, eff 6-18-10, EXPIRED: 6-18-18\n\nNew. #12557, INTERIM, eff 6-26-18, EXPIRED: 12-24-18\n\nNew. #12926, eff 11-26-19; ss by #14042, eff 8-6-24",
